WEBVTT

00:13.390 --> 00:14.730
Hey, Child Emperor...

00:16.730 --> 00:17.770
Can I ask you something?

00:18.570 --> 00:20.440
If you're hungry, you'll have to wait.

00:20.740 --> 00:22.070
Not that!

00:22.650 --> 00:23.990
After we escape from here

00:24.070 --> 00:26.700
you'll make sure to take me
to my dad, right?

00:27.080 --> 00:28.540
No, I can't go that far with you.

00:28.990 --> 00:33.250
The other heroes on the surface will
take over to protect you, so don't worry.

00:33.330 --> 00:34.870
The other heroes?

00:35.000 --> 00:36.460
You mean they're not Class-S?

00:36.710 --> 00:38.840
What?! No way!
They gotta be Class-S.

00:38.960 --> 00:40.510
No way.

00:41.510 --> 00:43.090
You saw me fighting, right?

00:43.510 --> 00:44.880
The enemy is strong.

00:44.880 --> 00:47.850
I have to get back to the battlefield
right away and support everyone.

00:49.720 --> 00:51.220
I'm worried about them.

00:52.270 --> 00:55.310
They don't know how to cooperate.

00:56.100 --> 00:58.110
So someone has to
be there to lead them.

01:00.650 --> 01:02.650
You're just a kid
and you're the leader?

01:02.860 --> 01:04.320
But they're all adults.

01:06.450 --> 01:08.530
Honestly, I wish someone else
would take over.

01:08.780 --> 01:09.620
But...

01:11.040 --> 01:13.750
Sorry, this isn't the time
to get into that.

01:14.330 --> 01:17.130
Don't worry.
I'm the class president, too.

01:18.210 --> 01:19.880
Although I don't go to school much.

01:20.750 --> 01:22.670
Look! We're almost at the exit.

01:23.590 --> 01:25.300
Come on, let's go. Waganma.

01:25.680 --> 01:27.550
Oh... Okay.

01:28.470 --> 01:29.510
You're right.

03:00.750 --> 03:03.770
TOP DRAGONS

03:05.690 --> 03:06.860
This is Child Emperor.

03:07.400 --> 03:10.280
I've successfully linked up with
the surface team along with Waganma.

03:10.700 --> 03:12.370
The rescue operation was a success!

03:12.740 --> 03:15.330
I repeat.
The rescue operation was a success!

03:16.040 --> 03:19.000
Child Emperor...
You are seriously incredible.

03:19.250 --> 03:21.580
Yes, your execution was flawless.

03:22.040 --> 03:24.790
You only think that because you didn't see
what happened out there.

03:25.170 --> 03:26.550
We barely made it out alive.

03:27.670 --> 03:29.380
No one's responding.

03:29.760 --> 03:32.090
Hello, is anyone listening?

03:33.720 --> 03:35.930
Are my messages getting through?

03:36.310 --> 03:39.140
Or even if they are,
is anyone actually checking them?

03:39.980 --> 03:42.020
Come on,
can we wrap this up already...

03:43.190 --> 03:49.190
Sekingal, I did explain
how to use the transmitters, right?

03:49.440 --> 03:52.240
Including checking
notifications regularly?

03:52.490 --> 03:56.870
Easy now, they might be
too busy fighting to look.

03:57.200 --> 03:58.370
<i>This is Zombieman.</i>

03:59.330 --> 04:01.370
<i>Good job, Child Emperor.</i>

04:01.830 --> 04:02.920
It's Zombieman...

04:03.620 --> 04:04.750
<i>This is Amai Mask.</i>

04:05.170 --> 04:09.170
<i>Got it about the hostage.</i>
<i>The monsters are no big deal.</i>

04:09.800 --> 04:12.220
<i>I will continue to carry out justice.</i>

04:12.590 --> 04:13.930
<i>Good job, Child Emperor.</i>

04:14.050 --> 04:16.640
<i>This is Pig God.</i>
<i>I am currently digesting.</i>

04:17.970 --> 04:19.560
<i>Hm? What's this?</i>

04:19.680 --> 04:21.640
<i>So I press here and talk?</i>

04:21.930 --> 04:23.190
It's Atomic Samurai!

04:24.940 --> 04:27.520
<i>What's this green flashing light?</i>

04:27.570 --> 04:29.150
That's my message.

04:29.980 --> 04:33.030
<i>Let's see now.</i>
<i>If I press here...</i>

04:33.490 --> 04:35.160
<i>Oh, the light went off.</i>

04:35.320 --> 04:38.330
Oh! He deleted it. Geez.

04:39.740 --> 04:42.120
<i>Ahh, this is Atomic Samurai.</i>

04:42.160 --> 04:45.960
<i>Well, everyone... If you have time,</i>
<i>listen to this message.</i>

04:46.500 --> 04:47.960
<i>I found a child.</i>

04:48.040 --> 04:48.920
<i>What?</i>

04:49.000 --> 04:51.800
<i>The location is...</i>
<i>Hmm, where am I...?</i>

04:51.880 --> 04:54.550
<i>Well, never mind.</i>
<i>I'll go after him.</i>

04:54.630 --> 04:57.680
Hello? This is Child Emperor.
What child?

04:58.430 --> 04:59.810
We lost the connection.

05:01.180 --> 05:02.140
Waganma.

05:03.480 --> 05:04.810
Do you know about this?

05:05.560 --> 05:07.900
So there was another person
held captive?

05:08.480 --> 05:12.030
Um... Well... So...

05:12.360 --> 05:13.490
You knew about it?

05:13.990 --> 05:17.280
Y-Yeah... B-But...
I just wanted to be saved...

05:17.320 --> 05:19.870
I'm s-s-sorry! Sorry!

05:20.120 --> 05:21.080
I have to go.

05:21.740 --> 05:25.500
Sekingal and the surface team.
Please take care of Waganma.

05:25.790 --> 05:28.000
Huh? Don't tell me
you're going back down there?

05:28.210 --> 05:29.130
Child Emperor!

05:29.340 --> 05:32.420
You look exhausted.
Can you still keep going?

05:33.050 --> 05:35.880
Rescuing Waganma was our priority,
and we've accomplished that.

05:36.340 --> 05:37.800
Perhaps it's best to reset...

05:40.970 --> 05:42.850
You don't get it, suit guy.

05:43.140 --> 05:45.850
Now that we know,
we got no choice but to go.

05:46.100 --> 05:47.230
I'll help too.

05:47.600 --> 05:48.940
Let us join you too.

05:49.440 --> 05:50.690
No, that isn't necessary.

05:51.730 --> 05:53.730
Let us each fulfill
our respective roles.

05:54.990 --> 05:55.860
<i>Class-S...</i>

05:56.360 --> 06:00.450
<i>I want to reach that level someday,</i>
<i>but it won't be easy.</i>

06:02.160 --> 06:04.000
You came outta nowhere
and tried to cut me.

06:04.450 --> 06:06.500
You trying to pick a fight?

06:06.790 --> 06:11.920
The hard-boiled, yet compassionate hero,
Atomic Samurai, has arrived!

06:12.170 --> 06:14.260
Some arrival...

06:14.670 --> 06:18.470
So you're the Atomic Samurai
Gyoro-Gyoro was talking about.

06:15.170 --> 06:22.150
THREAT LEVEL DRAGON:
BLACK SPERM

06:19.340 --> 06:22.850
You don't look like much,
but whatever.

06:23.180 --> 06:26.310
I've been bored out of my mind.
Entertain me.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.520
Oh yeah?

06:27.640 --> 06:29.730
But I've got no business with you.

06:29.900 --> 06:31.770
You're underestimating me, aren't you?

06:36.860 --> 06:37.740
Hmm.

06:37.860 --> 06:39.780
You underestimate me.

06:39.990 --> 06:43.240
Yeah. To be blunt,
this is going to be a piece of cake.

06:46.500 --> 06:48.160
I've been through countless battles.

06:49.040 --> 06:53.340
I've sliced up dozens of mutated,
gigantic freaks like you.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.210
I'm used to it by now.

06:59.340 --> 07:01.430
So you're the type
that can split up, huh?

07:01.760 --> 07:04.060
The most annoying kind.

07:04.310 --> 07:06.930
Annoying? You're a fool.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.980
You still think you can win?

07:09.480 --> 07:12.310
I'm a mass of countless versions of me.

07:12.940 --> 07:16.940
No matter how much you cut,
rip, beat, crush, or twist me

07:16.940 --> 07:18.360
I just keep multiplying.

07:20.110 --> 07:21.360
You're the fool.

07:21.740 --> 07:25.580
I'll just unleash countless slashes
on all of you and win.

07:25.950 --> 07:28.250
Do it if you can.
I'll make you weep.

07:28.790 --> 07:30.620
Come on, bring it on.
Let's do this.

07:51.060 --> 07:52.310
Atomic...

07:53.020 --> 07:54.020
Slash!!

07:56.110 --> 07:59.070
It's over. You're dead.

08:01.650 --> 08:02.660
<i>What the...?!</i>

08:02.780 --> 08:05.830
<i>He has this much power</i>
<i>even after splitting up?</i>

08:06.780 --> 08:08.120
<i>I underestimated him.</i>

08:08.370 --> 08:09.830
<i>This is bad, there's too many!</i>

08:29.810 --> 08:32.230
-So Gyoro-Gyoro had it figured out.
-It's no use.

08:32.350 --> 08:35.480
-Just accept it.
-We're the worst possible match for you.

08:36.150 --> 08:38.070
Heh. I'll bury you.

08:40.780 --> 08:41.860
The ceiling?!

08:45.070 --> 08:46.240
That shaking...

08:48.330 --> 08:49.870
I wonder how the battle is going.

08:49.950 --> 08:51.700
So you're worried?

08:51.830 --> 08:53.790
About how the other heroes
are getting killed?

08:54.170 --> 08:55.000
How did you—?

08:59.500 --> 09:02.010
Maybe they died like this?

09:02.300 --> 09:04.760
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
HOMELESS EMPEROR

09:02.420 --> 09:04.590
Dying instantly without
even being able to resist.

09:05.130 --> 09:08.140
So this is how
a so-called hero dies?

09:08.180 --> 09:09.720
How pathetic.

09:10.720 --> 09:13.520
I checked out the Hero Association's
official website.

09:13.770 --> 09:16.730
The Class-S heroes that are left...

09:17.190 --> 09:20.360
can easily by annihilated by just me!

09:20.400 --> 09:21.230
Wait!

09:39.000 --> 09:40.750
That looks painful.

09:41.170 --> 09:43.010
<i>Blocked at that range?!</i>

09:45.010 --> 09:48.010
<i>Tsk. I was saving this for last...</i>

10:00.310 --> 10:03.440
As expected of one of the top heroes.

10:03.570 --> 10:05.900
Even in death, you refuse to fall.

10:06.030 --> 10:08.110
You must have been quite strong.

10:08.910 --> 10:13.040
Yeah. I don't need a suit that
can withstand heavy bombing

10:13.120 --> 10:15.370
armor that can deflect bullets

10:15.450 --> 10:19.080
or an invincible shield that repels
any kind of physical attack.

10:19.710 --> 10:21.670
All I need is a spare change of clothes.

10:22.420 --> 10:25.010
And above all, I'm very particular
about my boxer shorts.

10:25.590 --> 10:28.470
I have no overwhelming power,
no superior physical ability

10:28.550 --> 10:30.970
no devastating weapons.

10:31.050 --> 10:33.510
The only thing I need to win
a battle is...

10:33.810 --> 10:36.640
The resolve to fight completely naked.

10:37.230 --> 10:40.440
And that's why boxer shorts
are non-negotiable for me.

10:40.520 --> 10:41.900
What are you talking about?

10:42.270 --> 10:44.280
<i>Seriously though,</i>
<i>this is no laughing matter.</i>

10:44.650 --> 10:46.190
<i>This monster is too strong.</i>

10:47.650 --> 10:48.490
Hey.

10:48.780 --> 10:52.780
I can't figure out that sneaky,
trick-like attack of yours.

10:53.580 --> 10:54.790
What the hell are you?

10:54.950 --> 10:56.660
I'm surprised.

10:56.870 --> 10:59.040
They don't call you Zombieman
for nothing.

10:59.330 --> 11:03.210
Being immortal wasn't just
a figure of speech, huh?

11:03.880 --> 11:07.130
So you want to know
the secret of this light's power?

11:07.970 --> 11:11.970
Fine... I'll tell you how
I acquired this power.

11:12.390 --> 11:16.770
Until a month ago, I stayed at a park,
living day by day.

11:18.180 --> 11:20.730
<i>I lost my job and got kicked out</i>
<i>of my home.</i>

11:20.850 --> 11:24.940
<i>I left human society behind</i>
<i>and lived as a recluse.</i>

11:25.270 --> 11:26.860
<i>At a welcome party</i>
<i>for new employees</i>

11:26.860 --> 11:29.820
<i>my boss ordered me</i>
<i>to dance naked.</i>

11:30.110 --> 11:33.030
<i>The next day,</i>
<i>I was fired for sexual harassment.</i>

11:33.990 --> 11:35.910
<i>But when I looked up at the sky</i>

11:35.950 --> 11:39.120
<i>my resentment toward</i>
<i>my boss no longer mattered.</i>

11:39.870 --> 11:42.420
<i>The Earth is bigger than any building</i>

11:42.540 --> 11:44.840
<i>and the sky is brighter than</i>
<i>any man-made light.</i>

11:45.460 --> 11:48.300
<i>Humans are but insignificant beings.</i>

11:48.960 --> 11:52.430
<i>My home is this vast Earth itself.</i>

11:53.140 --> 11:54.930
<i>And then it hit me...</i>

11:55.720 --> 12:00.180
<i>Humans have strayed from</i>
<i>the natural order of Mother Earth</i>

12:00.230 --> 12:03.980
<i>abandoning it to flourish selfishly</i>
<i>under our own rules.</i>

12:04.020 --> 12:06.070
<i>The stupidity of humans is staggering.</i>

12:07.190 --> 12:08.690
This is outrageous.

12:09.070 --> 12:13.410
To think these ignorant beings
treat me as inferior!

12:14.450 --> 12:15.620
It's unbearable.

12:16.910 --> 12:17.990
Just unbearable.

12:18.870 --> 12:20.250
So unbearable.

12:20.700 --> 12:23.040
<i>Humanity, with its shallow intelligence</i>

12:23.040 --> 12:25.920
<i>built this ugly, tiny,</i>
<i>and foolish world...</i>

12:26.090 --> 12:31.420
<i>To break free from it and</i>
<i>to truly return to Mother Earth...</i>

12:32.800 --> 12:35.050
<i>I had no choice</i>
<i>but to choose death.</i>

12:36.260 --> 12:37.680
<i>And that's when it happened.</i>

12:39.470 --> 12:42.560
<i>God appeared before my eyes.</i>

12:43.940 --> 12:45.400
<i>You are correct.</i>

12:45.730 --> 12:50.190
<i>Humans are fools.</i>
<i>But you do not need to die.</i>

12:51.070 --> 12:53.200
<i>I shall grant you power.</i>

12:53.740 --> 12:56.820
<i>You already know what</i>
<i>you must to do with that power.</i>

12:58.450 --> 13:02.540
In other words, this was a divine power,
given to me by God.

13:02.830 --> 13:06.670
And of course, I was chosen
because I know the answer.

13:07.710 --> 13:11.210
Humanity and its foolishness
are a harmful existence to this planet.

13:11.460 --> 13:13.420
The time has come for me

13:13.470 --> 13:16.510
to destroy its existence,
its civilization, all of it.

13:17.220 --> 13:22.220
<i>Oh crap, his story ended</i>
<i>before I could fully regenerate.</i>

13:23.140 --> 13:26.730
So what made you believe
that guy was actually God?

13:27.350 --> 13:28.810
Did it have some kind of ID?

13:29.110 --> 13:31.940
You do not need to believe in God

13:31.980 --> 13:33.530
and I've heard enough
of your nonsense.

13:34.320 --> 13:38.740
Atone for your excessive arrogance
by dying and returning to dust.

13:40.200 --> 13:42.790
Hey, is the ground all right here?

13:43.120 --> 13:45.160
I hope my place isn't falling apart.

13:47.080 --> 13:49.790
Maiko Plasma High Voltage Mode.

13:50.380 --> 13:52.590
Love Lightning Session.

13:54.880 --> 13:56.380
Take that!

13:58.510 --> 13:59.470
Did we beat him?

14:02.140 --> 14:03.600
What's with that pose?!

14:04.220 --> 14:08.020
Whoa... Class A and Class S
are on a different level...

14:08.400 --> 14:10.860
We should have had
the advantage in this matchup...

14:10.980 --> 14:13.610
The special attacks didn't work on him.

14:14.190 --> 14:15.740
What kind of body does he have?

14:16.150 --> 14:17.570
Why so surprised?

14:18.360 --> 14:22.030
I simply embraced the pain with
love deeper than the ocean.

14:22.830 --> 14:25.660
I call it the Angel Hug.

14:25.830 --> 14:28.290
-I don't get it.
-Who the hell is this guy?

14:29.000 --> 14:30.040
We're retreating for now!

14:32.590 --> 14:33.590
Where are you going?

14:34.460 --> 14:37.550
You think Gyoro-Gyoro and Orochi
would approve of you retreating?

14:34.630 --> 14:37.550
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
VACUUMER

14:37.720 --> 14:38.590
Shut up.

14:38.720 --> 14:41.970
Then you fight that freak alone.

14:42.100 --> 14:43.310
-Yeah, do it.
-Yeah, do it.

14:43.430 --> 14:44.850
Okay, will do.

14:45.180 --> 14:48.350
But first, I want your powers.

14:58.320 --> 14:59.780
Monsters killing monsters?

15:02.070 --> 15:05.240
You have no love...for your comrades.

15:06.910 --> 15:08.750
I'm done with the appetizers.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.170
Now for the main dish.

15:14.550 --> 15:16.340
I can use these superpowers

15:16.380 --> 15:19.930
however I want until I digest
and excrete them.

15:20.430 --> 15:25.180
I have more than enough time
to wipe out every last hero.

15:25.350 --> 15:29.020
Defeat them?
Impossible for someone like you.

15:29.390 --> 15:31.060
I'm a Class-S hero

15:31.100 --> 15:34.480
but compared to them,
I'm just an average man.

15:34.940 --> 15:37.820
Hey, Monster.
Before you go running your mouth

15:37.900 --> 15:42.410
let's see if you can take care of
this average adult male in front of you.

15:42.610 --> 15:44.950
What do you mean,
average adult male?

15:45.030 --> 15:46.160
You're a freak of nature!

15:49.500 --> 15:52.330
Looks like your body's
already screaming in pain.

15:52.460 --> 15:53.880
You're trembling...

15:54.000 --> 15:56.590
The electricity and poison
are taking a toll on you.

15:56.710 --> 15:58.260
This was bound to happen.

15:58.550 --> 16:00.470
Embracing the pain?

16:00.800 --> 16:02.510
It's all just tough talk.

16:04.430 --> 16:06.260
Your spirit may be tough

16:06.310 --> 16:08.930
but if your body can't keep up,
then it's pointless.

16:14.810 --> 16:17.020
What did you do?
What was that?

16:18.190 --> 16:23.110
Apparently, my love has given
birth to a new style.

16:24.530 --> 16:27.740
Vibration Angel descended!!

16:29.830 --> 16:30.660
Huh?

16:30.910 --> 16:35.250
Vibration Dark Angel Rush!!

16:39.510 --> 16:42.720
You... You truly are a freak.

16:50.060 --> 16:50.890
Honey!

16:51.350 --> 16:52.230
Let's get outta here.

16:52.600 --> 16:55.270
But what will Gyoro-Gyoro
and Orochi do to us?

16:55.480 --> 16:56.560
Who cares?

16:56.980 --> 17:01.690
My whiskers sense a huge earthquake
or even something bigger coming.

17:02.280 --> 17:06.530
Whoa, even the monsters
think he's a freak.

17:07.030 --> 17:08.080
<i>Those voices...</i>

17:08.450 --> 17:11.950
We've tried slitting his throat
so many times and failed every time.

17:12.120 --> 17:15.960
Never heard of anyone whose skin
can beat a razor except him.

17:16.130 --> 17:17.960
But today's the day we kill him.

17:18.250 --> 17:19.420
Prepare yourself.

17:19.550 --> 17:20.960
The boss of the stinky prison...

17:21.130 --> 17:25.880
No, our mortal enemy, the Class-S hero,
Puri-Puri Prisoner!

17:26.140 --> 17:28.760
My honeys who were taken away
by the monsters?!

17:28.970 --> 17:30.600
Why do you look like that?

17:30.810 --> 17:32.350
You look like monsters.

17:32.640 --> 17:34.430
Look who's talking!

17:35.140 --> 17:37.310
Damn that Monster Association.

17:37.650 --> 17:40.020
How could they be so cruel
to these helpless boys?

17:40.230 --> 17:41.730
Hang in there.
I'm coming to save you—!

17:43.490 --> 17:44.900
Who're you calling helpless?

17:43.650 --> 17:48.240
BAM POW WHACK

17:45.070 --> 17:46.780
He's so annoying. Get him!

17:46.950 --> 17:48.410
Suffer, you piece of trash!!

17:48.660 --> 17:50.950
Don't think this'll settle the score!

17:51.160 --> 17:52.790
We'll go back to the prison later

17:52.830 --> 17:56.210
and slaughter your friends
and the guards.

17:56.960 --> 18:01.880
Oh my god.
Monsterization has twisted their hearts.

18:02.210 --> 18:03.920
Wake up!

18:05.010 --> 18:07.590
Try to remember those glorious days.

18:08.180 --> 18:09.510
We ate and slept together.

18:10.100 --> 18:12.060
We sweated together doing
the same prison work.

18:12.260 --> 18:14.270
And we all loved each other
so dearly

18:14.390 --> 18:16.600
and were connected heart to heart.

18:16.850 --> 18:18.770
We remember.
That's why we're here for revenge!

18:18.770 --> 18:20.610
You were slacking off
during prison labor.

18:20.610 --> 18:22.860
Why doesn't anything
get through to this guy?

18:22.940 --> 18:24.610
I'll save you, no matter what.

18:24.650 --> 18:25.650
Just trust me.

18:25.690 --> 18:26.990
He's not listening...

18:27.030 --> 18:28.660
Once you turn into a monster

18:28.660 --> 18:30.700
you can never go back
to being a human.

18:31.620 --> 18:32.870
Too bad, huh?

18:33.790 --> 18:36.000
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
NYAAN

18:34.870 --> 18:35.830
<i>So sleepy...</i>

18:36.660 --> 18:40.420
My boyfriend's...hand-knit sweater...

18:41.130 --> 18:43.000
Okay... The rest is up to you, guys.

18:43.210 --> 18:45.510
Wow, so that's a top ranker...

18:45.760 --> 18:47.760
All right. This is
our chance to finish him off!

18:51.600 --> 18:53.060
He's still moving.

18:53.560 --> 18:57.230
My honeys will never
be human again?

18:58.140 --> 19:00.480
Heh, you're wrong.

19:01.560 --> 19:05.190
If your heart is human,
that makes you a true human being.

19:05.690 --> 19:06.860
I won't give up.

19:07.240 --> 19:09.990
I'm going to save my boyfriends,
no matter what.

19:10.110 --> 19:11.950
For love, nothing is impossible!!

19:12.160 --> 19:13.780
Man, he's not listening.

19:13.870 --> 19:15.290
And we're not your boyfriends.

19:15.410 --> 19:16.620
Who cares? Kill him!

19:16.750 --> 19:17.870
Kill him!

19:22.130 --> 19:23.590
He feels different?!

19:23.670 --> 19:24.630
What the—?

19:24.920 --> 19:26.710
<i>What happened?</i>

19:26.920 --> 19:33.900
RUMBLING

19:28.260 --> 19:29.630
<i>From all the accumulated damage</i>

19:29.630 --> 19:31.510
<i>his survival instincts were awakened</i>

19:31.890 --> 19:33.970
<i>and his body underwent</i>
<i>a rapid evolution...</i>

19:34.640 --> 19:35.610
<i>Something like that?</i>

19:35.850 --> 19:38.060
Have I grown angel wings?

19:38.180 --> 19:39.480
Obviously, it's just body hair.

19:39.600 --> 19:40.560
You're not an angel!

19:40.690 --> 19:41.940
Look how long it is!

19:42.060 --> 19:44.900
I shall call it,
Angel Bristly Armor.

19:45.110 --> 19:46.530
Knock it off with that pose.

19:46.820 --> 19:49.780
Now that I've gained defensive power...

19:50.110 --> 19:54.570
I'll cuddle with my honeys later
and go after that cat first.

19:55.990 --> 19:57.290
<i>I can't stand him.</i>

19:57.740 --> 19:59.620
<i>This feeling reminds me of...</i>

20:00.120 --> 20:03.710
<i>My former owner forcing</i>
<i>her affection on me.</i>

20:04.040 --> 20:05.090
Oh well, whatever.

20:05.290 --> 20:07.550
I'll leave him to the other top rankers.

20:08.670 --> 20:09.760
Through a gap like that?!

20:12.550 --> 20:16.140
Give me three millimeters and
I can slip through any gap.

20:16.810 --> 20:19.810
So I'll go after another hero. Bye!

20:19.850 --> 20:22.640
Hey, Prisoner.
We're gonna kill you...

20:22.690 --> 20:23.690
You're not getting away!

20:24.900 --> 20:26.570
Angel Crawl!

20:26.690 --> 20:28.820
I'll swim underground and chase
that cat monster.

20:30.190 --> 20:31.610
Doesn't make sense.

20:32.150 --> 20:33.030
Meow?!

20:33.240 --> 20:35.030
<i>I can sense him approaching.</i>

20:35.450 --> 20:37.620
<i>I instinctively detest this guy.</i>

20:38.330 --> 20:43.210
<i>I live a selfish existence.</i>
<i>I only fight who I want.</i>

20:43.540 --> 20:45.500
I'll chase you to
the ends of the earth.

20:45.540 --> 20:46.540
He's too much for me!

20:49.050 --> 20:50.630
Oh, you came back, Nyaan?

20:50.920 --> 20:52.510
Did you finish off Prisoner?

21:05.230 --> 21:06.230
<i>That cat...</i>

21:06.440 --> 21:08.770
<i>He said he'll go after other heroes...</i>

21:10.230 --> 21:11.650
<i>but he doesn't get it.</i>

21:12.320 --> 21:13.860
<i>I bet he'll regret it.</i>

21:14.530 --> 21:16.700
He'll soon realize that
going up against me

21:16.820 --> 21:18.700
would've been the better choice.

21:19.910 --> 21:22.120
They got caught in the crossfire!

21:22.870 --> 21:24.210
My boyfriends!

21:32.710 --> 21:36.510
I'll take this new attack
as a gift from all of you.

21:37.180 --> 21:38.970
Thank you, my honeys.

21:39.890 --> 21:41.970
I won't let your sacrifices be in vain.

21:42.680 --> 21:45.190
Please watch over me in this battle.

21:46.350 --> 21:47.310
Damn you...

21:53.990 --> 21:56.030
So it finally stopped, huh?

21:57.070 --> 22:00.160
What an awful, disgusting sound.

22:01.080 --> 22:04.200
Yet there was something
kind of sad about it.

22:04.540 --> 22:05.830
What the heck was that?

22:07.210 --> 22:09.840
Was it like the gates of hell
opening up or something?

22:11.460 --> 22:14.550
But seriously, what is this place?
It's ridiculously huge.

22:15.420 --> 22:17.800
I shoulda asked
those perverts for directions.

22:19.300 --> 22:20.180
All right.

22:20.510 --> 22:22.810
Next time I spot someone
who looks like they live here

22:22.890 --> 22:24.770
I'll grab them and
make them guide me.

23:56.150 --> 24:00.880
ULTIMATE LIFEFORM
